{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/409","id":5046649873,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVWUACM8AAAABLM3EEQ","html_url":"https://github.com/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pull/409","diff_url":"https://github.com/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pull/409.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pull/409.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/issues/409","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/409/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/409/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/issues/409/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/statuses/5645ada9beb7151649a1a3e7bec51057f584cc25","number":409,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Research: recover PumpSwap fee helper source coordinates","user":{"login":"Muzzy5150","id":210135147,"node_id":"U_kgDODIZoaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210135147?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150","html_url":"https://github.com/Muzzy5150","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzzy5150/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- recover the original source-line layout for the complete PumpSwap `ceil_div`\n  (`0x12b08`, 1,672 bytes) and `fee` (`0x13190`, 712 bytes) windows;\n- retain a research-only verification packet with source identity, selected\n  checkpoint diagnostics, complete 785-window census logic, direct-call checks,\n  hashes, and qualification limits;\n- leave the maintained PumpSwap checkpoint and its published **656/785\n  normalized / 148 raw** metrics unchanged.\n\nThe source edit is whitespace-only. Both parent and proposal reduce to the same\nwhitespace-stripped SHA-256:\n`cccc7b0c28e63a44592f58ea0965457350ae796053bf7c5eec0a63728bc09868`.\nNo formatter was run over the recovered layout.\n\n## Evidence\n\nThe actual selected checkpoint is\n`repro/pump_amm/private-sweep-recovery-20261027`, candidate\n`9278a52ae4fd93bb6159a72fa625f121394902a93f701d86931a7ec3778055fb`.\nIts complete inventory was recomputed as **656 normalized, 148 raw, 129\nunmatched out of 785**.\n\nBefore this proposal, its only normalized differences in the two target windows\nare three source-line immediates:\n\n- `ceil_div` original `0x12b08` -> candidate `0x226a0`: `18 -> 19` at\n  `+0x278`, and `19 -> 21` at `+0x630`;\n- `fee` original `0x13190` -> candidate `0x22d28`: `25 -> 32` at `+0x248`.\n\nThe proposed operations are on lines 19, 21, and 32. All 17 direct-call\npositions resolve: 16 targets are already normalized pairs, and `fee +0x70`\nresolves exactly to proposed `ceil_div` (`0x22d28 + 0x70 -> 0x226a0`).\n\nA separately measured Darwin arm64 v1.44 cohort produced:\n\n| | Baseline | Proposal |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| normalized matches | 651 | 653 |\n| raw matches | 139 | 139 |\n\nNew normalized windows were exactly `0x12b08` and `0x13190` (2,384 text\nbytes); there were no normalized or raw losses. Both complete windows had zero\nnormalized instruction differences, matching relocation shape, and aligned\n11/11 and 6/6 direct calls. The exact unstripped hashes are retained in\n`result.json`; whole-ELF and raw equality are false.\n\n## Verification\n\n```sh\npython3 -B repro/pump_amm/fee-helper-source-coordinates-20261028/verify.py\ngit diff --check origin/main...HEAD\n```\n\nVerifier result:\n\n```text\nsource_identity: ok\nselected checkpoint inventory: 656 normalized / 148 raw / 785\nselected diagnostic witnesses: 3 retained differences verified\nselected direct-call targets: 17/17 resolved\nmaintained checkpoint promoted: false\n```\n\nA fresh local v1.44 source build returned 0 (with the checkpoint's existing\n`admin_update_token_incentives` stack warning). The currently available\n`cargo-build-sbf 4.1.0` launcher produced a different, explicitly retained\nnegative-control cohort: 638 -> 638 normalized and 139 -> 139 raw, with no\ngains or losses. It therefore is not used for promotion.\n\n## Qualification limits\n\nThe authenticated Linux driver could not reach compilation on this Darwin arm64\nhost. Podman, the exact Linux/amd64 v1.44 SDK and authenticated archive, and the\nretained logical Cargo/target caches are unavailable. Therefore this PR is a\nresearch-only source proposal, not a maintained-checkpoint rebuild.\n\nNo new VM replay is claimed for the proposal: the Rust token stream is\nunchanged, but source diagnostics are observable and require the authenticated\nbuild plus the existing offline suites before promotion. No live transaction\nwas submitted, no historical evidence was edited, and no binaries or generated\ncaches are added.\n\nOpen PR #408 recovers a different `transfer_fee` caller and does not touch\n`programs/pump-amm/src/curve/fees.rs` or this research packet.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-28T07:10:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:10:43Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"92c1b378b04cad01ae061186ec73be1da81453de","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Muzzy5150:codex/amm-nearshape-recovery-20261027","ref":"codex/amm-nearshap